  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Freshly unmoored from college life and hiding a leave of absence, Yeong-In stumbles into the orbit of Ji-Heon—a solitary bookstore owner who seems to understand him like no one else. But when love blooms, Ji-Heon lays down one unshakable truth: “I want to watch my lover with someone else.” Desperate not to lose the only person who’s ever truly seen him, Yeong-In agrees to a love that hurts—until pain and pleasure begin to blur. In a relationship built on imperfection, how much can you give before you lose yourself completely?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
